OL,3,GNEWSATeens describe hopes and fears
OL,4,Aover climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeenagers have expressed a mix of worry
OL,7,Fand optimism about the future of the
OL,8,Fenvironment at a conference about
OL,9,Fsustainability.
OL,11,FSixth formers from two Wiltshire
OL,12,Fschools have explained how they feel
OL,13,Fwhile at an event for young people
OL,14,Fdiscussing sustainable solutions and
OL,15,Fthe future.
OL,17,FAnna said it is a "very big worry" and
OL,18,F"quite frustrating because it just
OL,19,Ffeels like not enough action is being
OL,20,Ftaken" while Jed said young people
OL,21,F"have a responsibility as the new
OL,22,Fgeneration".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
