OL,3,GNEWSATeens describe hopes and fears
OL,4,Aover climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were attending Sustain Britain
OL,7,FSchools Conference 2026, started by
OL,8,FSustain Britain after it realised last
OL,9,Fyear it did not have anybody under 35
OL,10,Fattending their usual event.
